#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.h2:9-1
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Ringkasan"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.h3:10-2
msgid "What is Ceno?"
msgstr "Apa itu Ceno?"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.p:11-2
msgid ""
"The world's first mobile browser that circumvents current Internet "
"censorship methods and local Internet outages using peer-to-peer (p2p) "
"technology. Ceno is envisioned as part of an Internet that is free of "
"intrusive and unjustified surveillance, censorship and oppression. It is "
"developed by <a href=\"https://equalitie.org\">eQualitie</a>"
msgstr ""
"Browser seluler pertama di dunia yang mengatasi metode sensor internet saat "
"ini dan gangguan internet lokal menggunakan teknologi peer-to-peer (p2p). "
"Ceno dirancang sebagai bagian dari internet yang bebas dari pengawasan yang "
"mengganggu dan tidak beralasan, sensor, dan penindasan. Aplikasi ini "
"dikembangkan oleh <a href=\"https://equalitie.org\">eQualitie</a>"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.h3:13-2
msgid "Works on:"
msgstr "Bekerja pada:"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:15-9
msgid "Android mobile devices"
msgstr "Perangkat seluler Android"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:16-9
msgid "Windows desktop devices"
msgstr "Perangkat desktop Windows"

