"href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?"
"id=ie.equalit.ceno\">Google Play</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/ceno-app/"
"ceno-android/releases\">Github</a>, <a href=\"https://paskoocheh.com/tools/"
"124/android.html?\">Paskoocheh</a>, dan <a href=\"https://zanga.tech/tools/"
"166/android.html\">Zanga.tech</a>"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:22-2
msgid "No special permissions are required"
msgstr "Tidak diperlukan izin khusus"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.h3:24-2
msgid "Why:"
msgstr "Mengapa:"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:26-9
msgid ""
"Designed to allow people anywhere in the world to access web content in "
"censored or Internet-restricted regions, and in countries where connectivity "
"is unreliable or costly"
msgstr ""
"Dirancang untuk memungkinkan orang di mana pun di dunia mengakses konten web "
"di wilayah yang diblokir atau memiliki pembatasan internet, serta di negara-"
"negara di mana konektivitas tidak dapat diandalkan atau mahal"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:27-2
msgid ""
"Can be used to create a bridge for others to access censored or restricted "
"content"
msgstr ""
"Dapat digunakan untuk membuat jembatan agar orang lain dapat mengakses "
"konten yang diblokir atau dibatasi"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.h3:29-2
msgid "So what?"
msgstr "Lalu apa?"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:31-2
msgid ""
"Already helping thousands of civilians, NGOs, investigative journalists and "
"independent media globally to access and share web content"
msgstr ""
"Sudah membantu ribuan warga sipil, LSM, jurnalis investigasi, dan media "
"independen di seluruh dunia untuk mengakses dan berbagi konten web"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:32-2
msgid ""
"Ceno content remains stable and cannot be forcibly removed by external "
"agents, even during media censorship events, shutdowns, natural disruptions, "
"unrest, conflict, and war"
msgstr ""
"Konten Ceno tetap stabil dan tidak dapat dihapus secara paksa oleh pihak "
"eksternal, bahkan selama peristiwa sensor media, pemadaman, gangguan alam, "
"kerusuhan, konflik, dan perang"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:33-2
msgid ""
"Ceno's p2p routing and distribution of storage can reduce bandwidth and "
"energy use"
msgstr ""
"Routing dan distribusi penyimpanan peer-to-peer (P2P) Ceno dapat mengurangi "
"penggunaan bandwidth dan energi"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:34-2
msgid ""
"Performance improves with scale (unlike the proxy/virtual private network "
"(VPN) model); more users reduces latency and increases storage"
msgstr ""
"Kinerja meningkat seiring dengan skala (berbeda dengan model proxy/jaringan "
"pribadi virtual (VPN)); semakin banyak pengguna, semakin rendah latensi dan "
"semakin besar kapasitas penyimpanan"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.h3:36-2
msgid "How:"
msgstr "Bagaimana:"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:38-2
msgid ""
"Works like BitTorrent - pulling, reserving and sharing content from many "
"networked sources rather than from one web server source - but is a browser"
msgstr ""
"Berfungsi seperti BitTorrent - mengunduh, menyimpan, dan berbagi konten dari "
"banyak sumber jaringan daripada dari satu sumber server web - tetapi "
"merupakan browser"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:39-2
msgid ""
"Underlying decentralized p2p network uses established open-source Ouinet "
"library and BitTorrent protocols, making it resilient and reliable"
msgstr ""
"Jaringan peer-to-peer (P2P) terdesentralisasi yang mendasarinya menggunakan "
"perpustakaan open-source Ouinet yang telah teruji dan protokol BitTorrent, "
"sehingga menjadikannya tangguh dan andal"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:40-2
msgid "Looks and feels like other browsers"
msgstr "Tampil dan terasa seperti browser lainnya"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:41-2
msgid ""
"Equipped to share cached content offline and on local area networks (LANs)"
msgstr ""
"Dilengkapi untuk berbagi konten yang disimpan dalam cache secara offline dan "
"di jaringan area lokal (LAN)"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.h3:43-2
msgid "Who is eQualitie?"
msgstr "Siapa eQualitie?"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:45-9
msgid ""
"Montreal-based digital security firm that has developed open-source and "
"reusable systems and tools since 2010, with a focus on online privacy, "
"resilience and self-determination"
msgstr ""
"Perusahaan keamanan digital berbasis di Montreal yang telah mengembangkan "
"sistem dan alat sumber terbuka yang dapat digunakan kembali sejak 2010, "
"dengan fokus pada privasi online, ketahanan, dan otonomi"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:46-2
msgid "Maintains the <a href=\"https://deflect.ca\">Deflect.ca</a> service"
msgstr "Menjaga layanan <a href=\"https://deflect.ca\">Deflect.ca</a>"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:47-2
msgid ""
"Leads several initiatives focused on free and secure communications in "
"authoritarian states"
msgstr ""
"Memimpin beberapa inisiatif yang berfokus pada komunikasi bebas dan aman di "
"negara-negara otoriter"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:48-2
msgid "Founded by Dmitri Vitaliev"
msgstr "Didirikan oleh Dmitri Vitaliev"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.h3:50-2
msgid "In use today:"
msgstr "Digunakan saat ini:"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:52-9
msgid "<strong>Average monthly users:</strong> 10,000+"
msgstr "<strong>Pengguna bulanan rata-rata:</strong> 10.000+"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:53-2
msgid "<strong>New monthly users:</strong> 10,000"
msgstr "<strong>Pengguna baru bulanan:</strong> 10.000"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.ul.li:54-2
msgid ""
"<strong>Majority users by country:</strong> Ukraine 48%; Russia 17%; Iran "
"15%; Myanmar 5%; Poland, US and Germany 3%"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Pengguna mayoritas berdasarkan negara:</strong> Ukraina 48%; Rusia "
"17%; Iran 15%; Myanmar 5%; Polandia, AS, dan Jerman 3%"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.h2:58-1
msgid "How Ceno Works"
msgstr "Bagaimana Ceno Berfungsi"

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.div.div.div.div.div.p:65-17
msgid "A mobile user in NYC reads a BBC.com news article on her Ceno Browser."
msgstr ""
"Seorang pengguna ponsel di NYC membaca artikel berita BBC.com di browser "
"Ceno-nya."

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.div.div.div.div.div.p:74-17
msgid "Ceno signs, caches and decentralizes the article content."
msgstr ""
"Ceno menandatangani, menyimpan, dan mendesentralisasikan konten artikel."

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.div.div.div.div.div.p:83-17
msgid ""
"Ceno users everywhere access and read the same article on their mobiles, "
"despite censorship or outages, and thereby share it with other Ceno users."
msgstr ""
"Pengguna Ceno di mana pun dapat mengakses dan membaca artikel yang sama di "
"perangkat seluler mereka, meskipun ada sensor atau gangguan layanan, dan "
"dengan demikian membagikannya dengan pengguna Ceno lainnya."

#: factsheet.html%2Bdiv.section.div:87-2
msgid "Learn more in the User Manual!"
msgstr "Pelajari lebih lanjut di Manual Pengguna!"

